        "id": 169021,
        "name": "MrLeRobot",
        "username": "MrLeRobot",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/{size}/1932_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-19T19:23:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I kept the small villain cards in my box because I find it nice to shuffle the stack of small villain cards (well, nicer than to shuffle the oversized cards...) to randomize setup. I'm mildly disappointed that the two latest promo villains didn't came with a small card.</p><p>Do you intend to recreate the smaller version of the promo villains? If you have the art available, could I ask for it and make them myself? Or should I ask for those particular pieces of art directly to the GtG staff...? I could make them more broadly available as well if there is any interest (and if it doesn't infringe any rules or anything)...</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:51:13.761Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
